# Line-ending + binary handling for this repository.
# This project is small (its screenshots are only a few hundred KB), so assets are
# stored as regular files and Git LFS is deliberately not used: that keeps the
# GitHub Pages checkout simple and guarantees the published site gets real images.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
